  faqs: { en: [
    { q: "Can I change candle colors in Tradovate?", a: "Yes. Open the Configure Chart Elements gear, click your instrument to open the Chart Editor, and set separate colors for the candle bodies, borders, and wicks on both up and down candles, then save." },
    { q: "How do I change the chart background color?", a: "The background sits in the Color Scheme settings, not the candle editor. Open the chart Settings menu, choose Color Scheme, copy or create a scheme, and edit the background there." },
